# The recovered sources are byte-identical to the originals served by the client's
# old host, which used LF endings. Force LF on checkout everywhere so that property
# survives cloning on Windows (where core.autocrlf would otherwise rewrite to CRLF).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
